    "all_paragraphs": [
        "Location:",
        "Shangri-La Hotel",
        "Address:",
        "10 Avenue d’Iéna,",
        "75116 Paris, France",
        "A one-of-a-kind fashion show that merges the real and virtual worlds, bringing together global and local brands, grunge culture, and bourgeois elegance. This is a show without an end, infinitely expanding in virtual reality, transcending the boundaries of time and space",
        ".",
        "​",
        ".",
        "The UNIQUE Fashion Foundation envisions a global stage where fashion becomes a powerful medium for cultural storytelling. We aspire to lead the industry toward sustainability by supporting designers committed to eco-friendly practices.",
        "By integrating technology, including a presence in the Metaverse, we aim to revolutionize how fashion is showcased, creating immersive, inclusive, and innovative experiences that connect designers, buyers, and audiences worldwide.",
        "​",
        ".",
        "May 24, 2025. Paris, France",
        "​",
        "A revolutionary fashion show that blurs the lines between reality and the virtual world, creating an immersive experience like no other. This unique event brings together the bold edge of grunge culture with the refined sophistication of bourgeois elegance, showcasing the creative synergy between global powerhouses and emerging local brands.",
        "​",
        "Far from a traditional runway show, it is an ever-evolving spectacle that continues infinitely in virtual reality, pushing the boundaries of what fashion can be. By transcending time and space, this show redefines how we experience style and creativity, offering a glimpse into the limitless possibilities of fashion’s future in a digital and interconnected world.",
        "​",
