        "Fashion-Themed Bars & Cuisine",
        "​",
        "The metaverse is transforming e-commerce, seamlessly integrating innovative technologies to provide an unparalleled shopping experience. UNIQUE will guide your brand through this new frontier, helping you unlock unique opportunities to engage with new customers in creative and immersive ways.​",
        "Opportunities:",
        "Virtual brand residency",
        "3D modeling of your collection",
        "Installation of 3D models",
        "Creation of basic Meta avatars",
        "Personalized Meta avatars for your brand",
        "NFT and Blockchain integration",
        "Virtual brand showroom",
        "Artist Romanoz unveils a world beyond physical existence, presenting the transcendental dimension into which David Lynch has transitioned. In his lifetime, Lynch sought to explore the depths of consciousness, and now he has become part of another reality, captured in Romanoz’s works.",
        "This exhibition is a visual representation of a realm beyond ordinary perception, where art serves as a bridge between worlds. Perhaps this dimension is not exclusive to Lynch…",
        "​",
        ".",
        "ROMANOZ: A TRANSCENDENTAL ARTIST",
        "​",
        "The Unique Fashion Show Paris 2025 will feature an exclusive exhibition by Romanoz, the founder of transcendental art, unveiling his new series. With over 28 years of experience, Romanoz is renowned for exploring consciousness and visual perception through art. Key projects include the 2019 Exhibition in the Stratosphere, the first art project at 43 km altitude, and the Stratosphere Gallery opening in 2021. His works are in private collections of figures like David Lynch and Björk. The exhibition during Unique Fashion Show Paris will showcase his latest pieces, continuing his exploration of space, form, and the subconscious.",
        ".",
        "The UNIQUE Fashion Foundation is a grand symbiosis of the physical and virtual worlds, where fashion becomes a language of cultural expression. The opening of the show will feature a collection of digital designs inspired by the scarf exhibition “A Woman in Search of Freedom” by artist Chandra Li. This project seamlessly blends art and fashion, emphasizing the philosophy of freedom, identity, and the beauty of women.",
        "​",
        ".",
        "The Scarf as a Symbol of Freedom and Boundaries",
        "For centuries, the scarf has accompanied women, reflecting their identity, beliefs, and status. It could serve as a protective veil or a barrier that conceals. It intertwines tradition, culture, and personal history, becoming both an adornment and a silent witness to a woman’s life.",
        "Exhibition Overview",
        "The collection consists of both physical and digital scarves, adorned with surreal and autobiographical works by artist Chandra Li. Each piece conveys the delicate nuances of female identity, strength, and vulnerability, exploring the fine line between freedom and restriction.",
        "Integration into Unique Fashion Show Paris",
        "The “Woman in Search of Freedom” exhibition will be a key highlight of the Unique Fashion Show, seamlessly blending with its philosophy of uniting fashion, art, and technology. It carries a central theme of women’s rights and freedom, using powerful symbolism to reference the oppression of women in Afghanistan.",
        "Scarves on Avatars.",
        "Each artwork inspires designers to create unique looks.",
        "Metaverse",
        "The digital collection of looks will be presented in the residence Unique Fashion show in the metaverse Spatial and will open the fashion show with a digital show.",
        "An art-fashion project by Chandra Li",
        "Presented at Unique Fashion Show, Paris.",
        "\"A surreal, autobiographical, psychosomatic story of all women in my mind.\" (Chandra Li)",
        "​",
